id=netstats-fix
name=Network Stats Fix (Universal GSI)
version=v4.1
versionCode=8
author=Flint
description=Fixes broken network traffic indicator and per-UID network stats on Android 12-16 GSIs. Now with improved BPF capability detection (kernel >= 5.0), proper legacy fallback handling, aggressive network_stats_enabled persistence, and enhanced cross-device compatibility for EvoX, Infinity X, Axion, and other Treble GSIs.
